<title>USA: New Ulm ISD, Minn., won by FBS Investment.</title>
<headline>New Ulm ISD, Minn., won by FBS Investment.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fbs Investment Services, Inc., said it won $10 million of New Ulm Ind Sch Dist No 88, Minn., general obligation school building bonds of 1996, with a net interest cost of 5.4099 percent.</p>
</text>
